# Boggart Prankster, "Whenever you attack, target attacking Goblin you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn" (CR 506.4, 115.1):
# Bot1 attacks with Bile-Vial Boggart and an Ornithopter and keeps the Prankster itself home. The Prankster, a Goblin Bot1
# controls but not attacking, is no legal target, nor is the Ornithopter (attacking, but no Goblin): the Boggart is the only
# one, so it is chosen without a question and is a 2/1 for the turn, the Prankster staying a 1/3.

